WEBVTT

00:03:29.121 --> 00:03:32.583
of finding common ground
and getting things done.

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:34.752
Now,

00:03:34.794 --> 00:03:38.464
that is not to say
that the truth doesn't exist,

00:03:38.506 --> 00:03:41.092
nor is it to say
that the truth isn’t important.

00:03:41.509 --> 00:03:46.722
Clearly, the search for the truth
has led us to do great things,

00:03:46.764 --> 00:03:48.683
to learn great things.

00:03:49.642 --> 00:03:51.185
But ...

00:03:51.227 --> 00:03:55.439
I think if I were to really ask you
to think about this,

00:03:55.481 --> 00:03:57.775
one of the things
that we could all acknowledge

00:03:57.817 --> 00:03:59.193
is that part of the reason

00:03:59.235 --> 00:04:02.989
we have such glorious chronicles
to the human experience